// # styles/ — The Single Stylesheet
//
// Logline: One CSS file, all themes + all layout.
//
// Beats:
//   1. main.css — minified single-line CSS. Defines:
//      a) 9 theme palettes via `[data-theme="…"]` blocks
//         (night, paper, magma, flare, solar, cyber, frost,
//         tokyo, laser)
//      b) layout (header, sidebar, main, footer)
//      c) the install box (.install, .install-cmd, .copy)
//      d) the gen bar (Gen 1-7 toggle buttons)
//      e) the dogfight canvas + sky starfield
//      f) the license badge animation
//      g) the responsive breakpoints (max-width 800px, 480px)
//
// Hand-maintained. Re-minify by hand if edited. No build step.
